        {
          "id": "upload",
          "title": "Extract the fields you need",
          "description": "The API stores each PDF in Cloud Storage and queues a job with its file reference. Cloud Tasks dispatches jobs to the File Processor on Cloud Run. The worker reads the PDF, asks a multimodal LLM to extract the requested fields, and checks each value against the source before saving it in Firestore. Ambiguous values stay null. The client sees the result when the job updates.",
